1993+ 7C2C BE               cp   (hl)
1994+ 7C2D 38 14            jr   c, .no_deplete
1995+ 7C2F
1996+ 7C2F                  ; Intervallo raggiunto: azzera timer e consuma 1 pixel di aria
1997+ 7C2F AF               xor  a
1998+ 7C30 32 EA B8         ld   (air_timer), a
1999+ 7C33
2000+ 7C33 3A E9 B8         ld   a, (air_pixels)
2001+ 7C36 B7               or   a
2002+ 7C37 28 0C            jr   z, .air_finished
2003+ 7C39
2004+ 7C39 3D               dec  a
2005+ 7C3A 32 E9 B8         ld   (air_pixels), a
2006+ 7C3D CD 23 6A         call Gfx_UpdateAirBar
2007+ 7C40
2008+ 7C40 B7               or   a
2009+ 7C41 28 02            jr   z, .air_finished
